item.panascais_caves:the_deep_mistake_scroll.title=Schriftrolle des tiefen Fehlers\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7They tunneled where no dwarf dared\nbefore. The pick struck stone, but\nthe stone bled black. The mountain\ntrembled and this was the first\nbreath "IT" took in millennia.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_deep_mistake_scroll.name=Schriftrolle des tiefen Fehlers
item.panascais_caves:the_binding_scroll.title=Schriftrolle der Bindung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Five mages stood beneath the\nmountain's heart, hands trembling\nwith grief. What they forged was not\nart, but warding-sigils drawn from\npain, hammered into silence.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_binding_scroll.name=Schriftrolle der Bindung
item.panascais_caves:the_scattering_scroll.title=Schriftrolle der Zerstreuung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7One beast, five wards. To keep it\ndreaming, the sigils were shattered\nand buried in places no map\nnames-where frost gnaws, fires weep,\nand nothing speaks.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_scattering_scroll.name=Schriftrolle der Zerstreuung
item.panascais_caves:the_glyphs_scroll.title=Schriftrolle der Glyphen\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7A stone altar listens beneath the\nworld. Five marks wait-not for\ntouch, but memory. The matching must\nbe true, or the silence deepens.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_glyphs_scroll.name=Schriftrolle der Glyphen
item.panascais_caves:the_awakening_scroll.title=Schriftrolle des Erwachens\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Stein cracks. Staub breathes. The\naltar groans beneath ancient weight.\nWhen the fifth mark finds its place,\nThe Serpent stirs. Coils unwind,\neyes open without light, and the\nmountain forgets its silence.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_awakening_scroll.name=Schriftrolle des Erwachens
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_flame_scroll.title=The Schriftrolle der Flammenprüfung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7In the lakes that blaze and howl,\nEmber waits behind walls of living\nfire. Only the worthy walk\nunscorched-their path cools where\nothers burn.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_flame_scroll.name=The Schriftrolle der Flammenprüfung
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_water_scroll.title=The Schriftrolle der Wasserprüfung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Water hides where ice breathes blue\nand light bends twice. Align the\nmirrors to reveal its shape-only\nperfect stillness sees what's real.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_water_scroll.name=The Schriftrolle der Wasserprüfung
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_wind_scroll.title=The Schriftrolle der Windprüfung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Wind drifts among open roots and\nquiet rivers. It does not lie still-\nfollow the breeze, and step where\nsilence welcomes you.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_wind_scroll.name=The Schriftrolle der Windprüfung
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_earth_scroll.title=The Schriftrolle der Erdprüfung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Buried in the earth, beneath dust\nand gemlight. Amethyst spires and\nbroken deserts hold its shape. Only\nthe heavy-hearted may lift it.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_earth_scroll.name=The Schriftrolle der Erdprüfung
item.panascais_caves:whispers_of_the_forgemaster_scroll.title=Whispers Of The Schmiedemaster Schriftrolle\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7It cleaves stone, splits timber, and\ncarves paths no other tool dares-\nRunenbrecher, the Schmiedemaster's last\ncreation. Not forged to fight, but\nto shape the world itself. The runes\nbend to its will. The mountain\nremembers its name.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:whispers_of_the_forgemaster_scroll.name=Whispers Of The Schmiedemaster Schriftrolle
item.panascais_caves:lost_in_collapse_scroll.title=Im-Einsturz-Verloren-Schriftrolle\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7When the serpent was sealed away and\nthe mountains fell silent, all\nrecords of the Runenbrecher vanished.\nSome say it lies buried beneath the\nbeast itself in the shattered altar,\nwaiting for a soul bold enough to\ndig deep.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:lost_in_collapse_scroll.name=Im-Einsturz-Verloren-Schriftrolle
item.panascais_caves:facets_of_power_scroll.title=Facetten-der-Macht-Schriftrolle\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Six gemstones-Saphir, Sphalerit,\nSmaragd, Rubin, Kristallopal, and\nOnyx- each forged as a fragment of\ndwarven mastery. Only when gathered\ncan the ancient tool be touched.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:facets_of_power_scroll.name=Facetten-der-Macht-Schriftrolle
item.panascais_caves:runes_in_stone_scroll.title=Runen In Stein Schriftrolle\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7The serpent bears five wounds hidden\nbeneath petrified coil. When it\nfalls, they open... and the\ngemstones call out.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:runes_in_stone_scroll.name=Runen In Stein Schriftrolle
item.panascais_caves:the_forgotten_trial_scroll.title=Schriftrolle der vergessenen Prüfung\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Im Hain, den die Zeit vergessen hat,\nschlafen Runen unter zerfallenden\nRelikten. Was die Welt vergisst,\ndafür wartet die Zeit geduldig auf\ndie, die das Verlorene suchen.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_forgotten_trial_scroll.name=Schriftrolle der vergessenen Prüfung
item.panascais_caves:the_runebreaker_scroll.title=Schriftrolle des Runenbrechers\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Setze die sechs Edelsteine in das\nein, was die Schlange verbirgt, und\nder Berg wird antworten. Das Relikt\nwird sich regen. Nicht mit Flamme\noder Stahl - sondern mit lange\nverwehrter Macht.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_runebreaker_scroll.name=Schriftrolle des Runenbrechers
